<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Acindar 9-mth net $20.4 mln. [CORRECTED 17:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Argentina's Acindar 9-mth net $20.4 mln. [CORRECTED 17:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31.</p>
<p>Nine Months.</p>
<p>Net $20.4 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: the company provided no comparative figures or EPS for the nine month period, nor results for the third quarter.  </p>
<p>In the first half it reported a $15.2 million net profit (corrects from &quot;loss&quot;) versus a $4.8 million net loss for the first half of the pevious year.</p>
<p>((--Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aies Newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
